<Step enable="True" id="89" name="# (comment)"><DisableStepCollapsed state="False"/><Restore state="False"/><Text>------------------------------
Revision change log - page 2
------------------------------
Only on a revised note. Drawn after page 1 is finished (its EndPage is above) and before DynaPDF.Save.
Page 1 was drawn bottom-up; this page is drawn top-down, and the setting is put back at the end.
Text is measured before it is written so a long change log carries onto further pages. Backslashes are doubled because WriteFTextEx treats \ as the start of a formatting tag.</Text></Step>
